  "ported": {
    "separation": "0x59a49c: abs RA difference, if>12 subtract from24; x=dRA*15*cos(pointingDec*original Extended degrees-to-radians); y=pointingDec\u2212sourceDec; sqrt(x*x+y*y). Supplied valid hour/degree coordinates; flat metric, not a spherical-distance replacement.",
    "pointBranch": "0x50059f..0x500668; input types0/2/3 have a defined point branch, supplied radius/separation/width only",
    "stackArguments": "After reserving12 bytes for -(r+d)/s, [esp+0x54] resolves the original lower-bound word at old+0x48; subsequent pushes send (r-d)/s as near argument.0x55fa24 returns lookup(near)\u2212lookup(far).",
    "normalTable": "100 subdivisions,101 values. table0=0; values1..100 integrate from\u22125 to each point. Density exp(\u2212x\u00b2/2)/sqrt(2pi), trapezoid/Simpson extrapolation, max10 strict relative1e\u22127. Native constructor repeats Extended0.1 increments; Number adapter uses explicit indexed coordinates.",
    "lookup": "x<\u22125\u21920, x>5\u21921; interior linear interpolation. x=+5 can address index101 beyond allocated101-entry table; bounded port rejects this endpoint/rounded-index100. No erf replacement or hidden endpoint clip.",
    "attenuation": "fraction>0: m\u22122.5log10(f); native f<=0\u2192literal30. Port rejects negative or>1 f. Zero sentinel is not a physical observation.",
    "combination": "near\u22122.5log10(1+10^((far\u2212near)/\u22122.5)); original caller passes attenuated neighbor near, accumulated central far. Number overflow/underflow rejected.",
    "knownColorUbv": "Native Single V/B\u2212V/U\u2212B projected with fround; B=V+(B\u2212V), U=B+(U\u2212B); central attenuation then ordered positive-neighbor fold.10,000-neighbor bound is new. Central fraction0 and color>=30 cases withheld. R/I/image branches excluded."
